"text":"테이블을","x":1330,"y":329,"width":134,"height":38}]},{"text":"설정하면서 BGP 경로 선택 알고리즘을 수행하여 해당 IP 주소로의 “최고의” 경로(예","words":[{"text":"설정하면서","x":176,"y":387,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"BGP","x":359,"y":392,"width":75,"height":28},{"text":"경로","x":450,"y":388,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"선택","x":531,"y":387,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":610,"y":387,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"수행하여","x":787,"y":387,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"해당","x":933,"y":387,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":1013,"y":392,"width":34,"height":29},{"text":"주소로의","x":1061,"y":388,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"“최고의”","x":1209,"y":388,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"경로(예","x":1353,"y":390,"width":108,"height":39}]},{"text":"를 들면, AS 흡카운트 측면에서 가장 가까운 경로)를 골라낸다. 예를 들어 (어떤 위치","words":[{"text":"를","x":174,"y":450,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"들면,","x":219,"y":448,"width":78,"height":37},{"text":"AS","x":313,"y":452,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"흡카운트","x":376,"y":448,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"측면에서","x":525,"y":447,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"가장","x":671,"y":448,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"가까운","x":751,"y":447,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"경로)를","x":863,"y":448,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"골라낸다.","x":986,"y":447,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1145,"y":448,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"들어","x":1223,"y":449,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"(어떤","x":1304,"y":450,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"위치","x":1399,"y":450,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"로의) 한 BGP 경로가 라우터로부터 단지 한 AS 홀 길이이고, (다른 위지로의) 모든","words":[{"text":"로의)","x":174,"y":508,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":270,"y":509,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"BGP","x":320,"y":512,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"경로가","x":414,"y":508,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"라우터로부터","x":530,"y":507,"width":192,"height":39},{"text":"단지","x":742,"y":508,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":822,"y":508,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"AS","x":871,"y":512,"width":45,"height":30},{"text":"홀","x":934,"y":508,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"길이이고,","x":984,"y":508,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"(다른","x":1142,"y":508,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"위지로의)","x":1237,"y":509,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"모든","x":1399,"y":511,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"다른 경로가 두 AS 홀 이상의 길이라면 BGP 라우터는 한 떨어져 있는 위치로 패것","words":[{"text":"다른","x":174,"y":570,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"경로가","x":254,"y":569,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":368,"y":570,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"AS","x":414,"y":572,"width":47,"height":29},{"text":"홀","x":475,"y":568,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"이상의","x":523,"y":568,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"길이라면","x":634,"y":568,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"BGP","x":775,"y":573,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"라우터는","x":862,"y":568,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1005,"y":569,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"떨어져","x":1097,"y":569,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1210,"y":569,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"위치로","x":1287,"y":570,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"패것","x":1400,"y":570,"width":63,"height":37}]},{"text":"을 전송할 것이다. 이러한 최초의 BGP 주소 알림 단계 이후에 CDN은 주된 작업인 킨","words":[{"text":"을","x":173,"y":631,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"전송할","x":220,"y":630,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":336,"y":629,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":460,"y":628,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"최초의","x":572,"y":629,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"BGP","x":681,"y":633,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"주소","x":767,"y":630,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"알림","x":846,"y":629,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"단계","x":923,"y":629,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"이후에","x":1004,"y":629,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"CDN은","x":1114,"y":629,"width":115,"height":37},{"text":"주된","x":1240,"y":630,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"작업인","x":1320,"y":631,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"킨","x":1435,"y":631,"width":30,"height":37}]},{"text":"텐츠 배포를 할 수 있다. 사岳자가 비디오를 요청하면 CDN은 사용자가 어