"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"패것","x":1402,"y":813,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"을 BGP 경로 선택 알고리즘이 정의한 가장 “가까운\" 서버로 전달한다.","words":[{"text":"을","x":173,"y":875,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"BGP","x":217,"y":878,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"경로","x":307,"y":873,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"선택","x":387,"y":873,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":468,"y":873,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"정의한","x":649,"y":873,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"가장","x":759,"y":873,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"“가까운\"","x":836,"y":873,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"서버로","x":976,"y":874,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"전달한다.","x":1090,"y":874,"width":138,"height":38}]},{"text":"CDN을 이용한 위의 예가 IP 애니캐스트가 어떻게 사용되는지 잘 설명해 주기는","words":[{"text":"CDN을","x":236,"y":935,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"이용한","x":370,"y":934,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"위의","x":487,"y":935,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"예가","x":569,"y":935,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":649,"y":939,"width":33,"height":29},{"text":"애니캐스트가","x":699,"y":935,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":911,"y":935,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"사용되는지","x":1024,"y":935,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"잘","x":1207,"y":935,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"설명해","x":1255,"y":935,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"주기는","x":1368,"y":936,"width":101,"height":38}]},{"text":"하지만, 실제로 CDN은 일반적으로 IP 에니개스트를 사용하지 않는다. 이유는 BGP","words":[{"text":"하지만,","x":174,"y":996,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"실제로","x":300,"y":996,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"CDN은","x":419,"y":997,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"일반적으로","x":555,"y":997,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"IP","x":736,"y":1001,"width":33,"height":28},{"text":"에니개스트를","x":787,"y":996,"width":199,"height":38},{"text":"사용하지","x":1002,"y":996,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":1154,"y":997,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"이유는","x":1281,"y":997,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"BGP","x":1395,"y":1001,"width":74,"height":30}]},{"text":"